ajV(a,b,c){return"How it works\n\u2022 You bought a car \u2014 you have "+a+" days to register it. You can sell it earlier under a sales contract without registration.\n\u2022 Apply here, the inspection takes place at the traffic police site in the city where the car is (one hour). State fee "+b+", the plates stay.\n\u2022 The inspection checks the VIN and bans \u2014 hidden problems of the car will surface.\n\u2022 Missed the deadline \u2014 fine "+c+" (art. 19.22 of the Code of Administrative Offences).\n\u2022 Changed the details in your passport \u2014 the cars must be registered again."},
